  "prefLabel": "Odb 208.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 208.01 Applicability. Any interested person may submit a petition for a declaratory ruling on the applicability of any statute, rule, or order administered or enforced by the board. The rules in this part shall apply to any petition for such ruling.\n\nSource. #8490-A, eff 11-22-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/odb100-600.html"
